OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPersistent
OL,6,Frain, occasionally heavy, will extend
OL,7,Fnortheast this evening. Then becoming
OL,8,Fdry in the early hours with clear
OL,9,Fperiods. Southeasterly gales easing by
OL,10,Flate evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FDry in the morning with some
OL,13,Fsunshine. Cloudier at times in the
OL,14,Fafternoon with a few showers. Fresh
OL,15,Fsouthwesterly wind.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FWindy
OL,18,Fon Monday with rain at times. Early
OL,19,Frain on Tuesday followed by a few
OL,20,Fshowers. Bright and breezy with
OL,21,Fshowers on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
